<title>FRANCE: Parliament adopts consumer report.</title>
<headline>Parliament adopts consumer report.</headline>
<dateline>STRASBOURG, France 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Parliament on Thursday adopted at first reading the proposal for an EU system to help people go to court in cross-border consumer disputes.</p>
<p>Under the proposal member states would designate national bodies through which consumers could pursue their complaints.</p>
</text>
